      "type": "verse",
      "speaker": "sacerdos",
      "voice": "clara",
      "translation": {
        "pl": "W owym czasie, gdy Jan usłyszał w więzieniu o dziełach Chrystusa, posłał dwóch swoich uczniów i zapytał Go:",
        "en": "At that time, when John heard in prison of the works of Christ, he sent two of his disciples and asked Him:"
      },
